    "features": [
      "RV32EC + Zcb + Zicond \u2014 area-optimized (16 registers, compressed)",
      "Nibble-serial execution from external QSPI Flash; QSPI PSRAM for data \u2014 no on-chip program memory",
      "28-bit addresses / 24-bit program space; hardcoded gp/tp",
      "On-chip peripherals: UART, debug-UART (TX), SPI, PWM, GPIO, timer",
      "Silicon-proven on Tiny Tapeout 10 (sky130); FPGA on iceFUN / pico-ice (iCE40)",
      "SDK + example programs upstream"
    ]
